      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The area is a triangle of area \\[\\dfrac {4\\cdot 5}2 - \\dfrac{2\\cdot 4}2 = 10-4 \\]\\[= 6\\] since we subtract the area of a smaller triangle from a larger triangle.\n\nThus, the answer is B .",
